4 3. solatium u/s 23 (2) of LA Act @ 30% on the enhanced amount of market value ;
4. interest under Section 28 of L.A Act @ 9% per annum for the first year from the date of dispossession and at the rate of 15% per annum on the difference between the enhanced signed by SIDHARTH SIDHARTH MATHUR MATHUR Date:
